  "title": "Light Smoky Malaysian Fennel Curry",
  "description": "A smoky and light Malaysian curry featuring fennel bulb, perfect for a sick day, made with dairy-free friendly ingredients and cooked to perfection in a pressure cooker served in a lazy-susan-spinner vessel.",
