  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in the pressure cooker over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for another minute.",
    "Add the chopped fennel bulb and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the curry powder and smoked paprika and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and add the salt and black pepper.",
    "Close the lid of the pressure cooker and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Let the pressure release naturally, then open the lid and stir the curry.",
    "Serve the curry hot in the lazy-susan-spinner vessel."
  ],
